        <headline>Hydrologic Outlook issued September 11 at 4:38PM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK</headline>
        <description>ESFAFG

...Locations Impacted...
Streams draining southern slopes of the Western Brooks Range.

Rainfall over the last few days will be tapering off into Saturday.
This rain has produced rises on area streams and rivers (Kobuk,
Noatak, Wulik and others) These rises will continue downstream
through the weekend.  No flooding is expected.
</description>
